WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.801
-Finally, we have
exactly 10 shows left

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.801
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.400
for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.667
It's time for "12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.133
-♪ 12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:16.334
♪ Ten days left ♪

00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:17.467
-That's right.

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:19.567
Every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:21.868
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.801
an exquisite Christmas sweater

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:25.701
from the Countdown to Christmas
Cabinet.

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:27.400
Now, since there are
10 shows left,

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.100
let's open door number 10.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:34.267
Ready for this?

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.234
Ooh! [ Laughs ]

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:37.400
Wow.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:43.934
Wow.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:46.634
This is --

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:49.033
Oh, my gosh.

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.300
Wow.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.267
Alright.

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:56.901
Now let's see who's gonna
go home with tonight's sweater.

00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:58.567
Everyone look
at your seat number.

00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:00.467
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.033
Quest, can I get
a drum roll, please?

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:03.667
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.300
Who wants this sweater?!
It's a good one!

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.901
216!

00:01:09.901 --> 00:01:12.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:15.367
Come on! Come on!

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:24.300
♪♪

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.200
Come on! How you doing?

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:30.067
Nice to see you. How are you?
Why don't you stand over there?

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:31.400
Here you go.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.400
What is your name
and where are you from?

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.834
-I'm Leah. I'm from Germany.

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:36.501
-Yeah! Leah from Germany!

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:38.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.534
Wow. We love Germany.
Thanks for coming to the show.

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:42.234
I appreciate this.
It gets cold in Germany, right?

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:43.501
-It does.
-Yeah.

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:44.934
Do you have anything like this?

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.234
-Not yet.
-Yeah.

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:48.167
Would you like to try it on?
-Absolutely.

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.300
-Yeah. Here. Go for it.
This is gonna be fun.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.534
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:53.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.501 --> 00:02:00.200
♪♪

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:03.000
-You're -- It's very --
Oh, yeah!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.801
This is good.

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.100
Wow!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.133
Stunning! Stunning!
Gorgeous!

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:10.400
That's what I'm talking about.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.067
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.501
I appreciate this.

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:15.968
Let's give our winner a round
of applause. Stick around.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:18.501
We'll be right back
with Selena Gomez, everybody!

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:20.234
Come on back!

00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:26.133
♪♪

